  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "媽媽！你緊tńg--來"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳春美</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「Tang！Tang！Tang！」下課ê鐘仔聲tân--ah，雄雄想著一層代誌ài hua̍t-lo̍h，手機仔suah無電；臨時臨iāu hōo人揣來代課，地頭生疏人無熟，mā歹勢去kā人借電話，姑不而將行出五樓ê教室，落去樓跤khà公用電話。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我ná攑電話ná jîm錢，雄雄一个細粒子ê查埔學生tsông倚--來，無講無tànn kā電話搶--去，koh隨lok銀角仔落--去，我一時bē赴反應，就聽著幼tsínn ê囡仔聲：「媽媽！你緊tńg--來，好--無？我kap爸爸講好--ah！伊bē koh kā你拍，媽媽！我tsiok想--你--ê，你緊tńg--來--lah！」我gāng-gāng徛tī電話邊，看伊neh跤尾ná講ná koo-tsiânn，一聲一聲ê哀求鑽入耳，目屎無張無持一滴一滴，ná像是tsūn bē ân ê水道頭，一直輾--落-來。He目屎tsiok成ē kā人sīnn，sīnn kah連心mā ē疼。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「媽媽！你母親節ài tńg--來--őo！老師有教阮做剪絨仔花kap寫卡片，你一定ài tńg--來--őo！媽媽！拜託--lah！」看伊kā電話囥倒tńg--去，我緊kā銀角仔tu倚--去：「緊！緊！緊！你緊koh khà，老師tsia有銀角仔。」「M̄免--lah！阮媽媽講伊上班時間bē-tàng講電話。」查埔囡仔頭lê-lê ná juê目睭ná kā我應，kánn-ná驚hōo我看著伊ê目屎。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">看伊兇兇狂狂走離開ê形影，我suah感覺頭殼gông-tshia-tshia、胃幽幽仔疼，心肝bē輸像針leh ui，我kap伊無熟sāi，m̄-koh，我suah替伊煩惱。是啥mih款ê家庭？啥mih款ê序大？Tio̍h-ài hōo一个囡仔囝苦苦哀求？Koh想著hit个離開心肝仔囝ê老母，因為家庭暴力被迫骨肉分離，tsit款割心腸ê疼，真正是講bē出喙ê艱苦。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tiānn聽人講時代無仝--ah，查某人出頭天，m̄免koh像以早hōo人講是弱者，tio̍h-ài倚靠查埔人生活，規工顧翁顧囝顧hit口鼎，為著家庭ê圓滿，忍受無理ê對待、失去自我。M̄-koh，家庭出問題，女性kap囡仔tsiânn做受害者ê狀況，suah猶原不管時lóng leh搬演。逐遍若是看著青色ê公用電話，我就ē想著hit个neh跤尾leh khà電話ê形影，m̄知hit个老母有tńg--去--無？我恬恬仔祈禱in母仔囝早日團圓，耳空邊ná像koh傳來he一句一句「媽媽！你緊tńg--來，好--無？」</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjVyy9veFZV4DVHSRiQjPfZW-_NsKedUWB_crdW5mCh30jOWKkAByG2-IcehfgJDwJXsHX2dloef8U22HAUGtYSYdQwu19oKH3v4mQhIf8KTX6fpWATiNiathca60ypVWfuY5ju_KdkQMp-aJDAGwfyP-Q9UwtWYN8JddBMx6hhfW0Z7TPAovG1Cuj6VT74/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1360%E6%9C%9F_39.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjVyy9veFZV4DVHSRiQjPfZW-_NsKedUWB_crdW5mCh30jOWKkAByG2-IcehfgJDwJXsHX2dloef8U22HAUGtYSYdQwu19oKH3v4mQhIf8KTX6fpWATiNiathca60ypVWfuY5ju_KdkQMp-aJDAGwfyP-Q9UwtWYN8JddBMx6hhfW0Z7TPAovG1Cuj6VT74/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1360%E6%9C%9F_39.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdL_87KQuuGUp0XlsioK1Zs0lvmq-4T6LHGbLlp8899siE5V_dgPz2V-ReQkHQQhvfAqk5yOtOIScGN9IxBqNPOf1cABV1h4fDatDxKlFdmuprc2j8r9riqrOSn_7MJY2aNpPNwRG1gw-oJXOqUXnUc3YymJl94koz3qtXrqXZCQlgwpcZ1lFUzzHV4I6x/s1424/360%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdL_87KQuuGUp0XlsioK1Zs0lvmq-4T6LHGbLlp8899siE5V_dgPz